<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Simple Flask App</title>
    <style>
        table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #d9d9d9; padding: 6px 8px; text-align: left; white-space: nowrap; }
        td.td-num { text-align: right; }
        td.td-text { text-align: left; }
        thead th { background: #2f5fa7; color: #ffffff; }
        tbody tr:nth-child(odd) { background: #ffffff; }
        tbody tr:nth-child(even) { background: #f2f2f2; }
        thead th:hover { background: #234a82; }
        input { padding: 6px 8px; border: 1px solid #ccc; border-radius: 4px; }
        table.usd-table thead tr:first-child th.usd-group-header {
            background: #1a73e8;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        table.usd-table thead tr:first-child th.usd-group-empty {
            background: #e8eef7;
            color: #333333;
        }
        table.usd-table thead tr:nth-child(2) th.usd-sub-header {
            background: #d0dbf0;
            color: #111111;
            font-size: 11px;
        }
        table.usd-table thead tr:nth-child(2) th.usd-sub-header:hover {
            background: #b8c9e8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

	<select onchange='select_view()' id='select_view' >
        <option>PICK</option>
        <option>Jarvis</option>
        <option>OTR</option>
	<option>OCEAN</option>
        <option>Seam Tariffs</option>
        <option>Cert Tariffs</option>
        <option>USD</option>
        <option>PTS</option>
        <option>CIF</option>
        <option>Regions and Ports</option>
	</select>
    <p style="font-size:12px;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0 0;">Global rates and USD inputs: choose <strong>Jarvis</strong>, edit numbers, click <strong>Save</strong> (writes <code>data/control_panel.json</code>, plus <code>data/drayage.json</code>, <code>data/document_cif.json</code>, and <code>data/usa_forwarding_cost.json</code>). In the <strong>USD</strong> view, Outbound <strong>Ocean base</strong> is <strong>OceanBase ÷ 88</strong> from drayage by row <strong>Port</strong>. Or open <a href="#jarvis">#jarvis</a> (legacy <a href="#javis">#javis</a> or <a href="#control-panel">#control-panel</a> still opens Jarvis).</p>
    <hr>
    <div id="content">

    </div>

    <script src="{{ url_for('static', filename='usd.js') }}"></script>
    <script src="{{ url_for('static', filename='pts.js') }}"></script>
    <script src="{{ url_for('static', filename='cif.js') }}"></script>
    <script src="{{ url_for('static', filename='db.js') }}"></script>
    <script src="{{ url_for('static', filename='script.js') }}"></script>
</body>
</html>
